I agree with KPD here (*gasp!*). My feelings can be summed up by: it's 
part of the game; why take it out?

Just because someone CAN have a slightly easier time through the game 
with Pudding farming doesn't mean you have to. If you've really ascended 
so many times that Pudding farming makes the game EASY, you probably 
have the self control to avoid it yourself. Nethack is largely about 
personal challenges: can I ascend as a tourist? Can I do it without 
genociding? While roleplaying? Without spoilers? If pudding farming is 
what seperates a player's YAFAP from YASD, then I fully support it.

